{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42378","headline":"太傅相公深感庭梅再成绝唱曲垂借示倍认知怜谨用旧韵攀和 · 徐铉","name":"太傅相公深感庭梅再成绝唱曲垂借示倍认知怜谨用旧韵攀和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禁省繁华地，含芳自一时。\n雪英开复落，红药植还移。\n静想分今昔，频吟叹盛衰。\n多情共如此，争免鬓成丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}